## 5. Salvar as consultas de relatório

Para cada uma: colar → **Save → Save as query**.

**Deny – detalhe**

```kusto
DenySecPolicies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| project DateTime, SubscriptionName, SubscriptionId, ResourceGroup, Resource, ResourceType,
          Initiative, Policy, Assignment, AssignmentMG, Caller, CallerIpAddress, CorrelationId
| order by DateTime desc
```

**Deny – um registro por deploy bloqueado**

```kusto
DenySecPolicies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| summarize Policies = make_set(Policy), Initiatives = make_set(Initiative)
    by DateTime, SubscriptionName, SubscriptionId, ResourceGroup, Resource, Caller, CorrelationId
| order by DateTime desc
```

**Deny – por iniciativa**

```kusto
DenySecPolicies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize BlockedDeployments = dcount(CorrelationId), Subscriptions = dcount(SubscriptionId)
    by Initiative, AssignmentMG
| order by BlockedDeployments desc
```

**Deny – top 20 policies**

```kusto
DenySecPolicies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize BlockedDeployments = dcount(CorrelationId) by Initiative, Policy
| top 20 by BlockedDeployments
```

**Deny – por subscription**

```kusto
DenySecPolicies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize BlockedDeployments = dcount(CorrelationId) by SubscriptionMG, SubscriptionName, SubscriptionId
| order by BlockedDeployments desc
```

**Deny – por subscription e policy**

```kusto
DenySecPolicies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize BlockedDeployments = dcount(CorrelationId) by SubscriptionName, Initiative, Policy
| order by SubscriptionName asc, BlockedDeployments desc
```

**Deny – top callers**

```kusto
DenySecPolicies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize BlockedDeployments = dcount(CorrelationId), Subscriptions = make_set(SubscriptionName, 10),
            Policies = make_set(Policy, 10) by Caller
| top 20 by BlockedDeployments
```

**Deny – tendência semanal**

```kusto
DenySecPolicies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)
| summarize BlockedDeployments = dcount(CorrelationId) by bin(TimeGenerated, 7d), Initiative
| render timechart
```

